Just wondering if anybody ever noticed the fact that Dr. Black Jack
and Pinoko (from the Manga and Anime Black Jack, created by Osamu
Tezuka) are available as a tile for the Healer class in NetHack?

Being a big fan of Black Jack (along with pretty much everything else
Osamu Tezuka made), I spotted this instantly when I saw my friend
playing NetHack with tiles as a healer (I was like "Holy shit! Is that
Black Jack and Pinoko?!?!", and later I showed him the anime, to which
he was surprised as well), but never bothered to bring it up. I never
saw anybody mention it before, I figure very few people ever noticed
or got the reference, considering Osamu Tezuka's works aren't terribly
popular outside of Japan (which is a big shame).

A picture a healer with the Black Jack & Pinoko tile is currently
available on Wikipedia: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Image:NetHack-ascension.png

It is also the tile in the bottom third row, ten squares from the
left, in this: http://rltiles.sourceforge.net/nh-mon.html

I'm sure people have noticed Indiana Jones on there (NetHack itself
starts you off with a fedora and a whip... >_>), and possibly noticed
Doraemon as the Mail Daemon, but I just thought I'd get this off my
chest and finally ask about this.

For more information about Black Jack, you can refer to the Wikipedia
article: http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_Jack_%28manga%29

Thanks for reading, and happy hacking!



